00:00:00,257 --> 00:00:03,427
(Emily:)so if you get scared,
I can totally change your diaper.

2
00:00:04,828 --> 00:00:07,278
(Raj:)Actually, I have to
tell you something.

3
00:00:07,430 --> 00:00:10,100
(Raj:)These kind of movies
really aren't my thing,

4
00:00:10,267 --> 00:00:13,947
(Raj:)so, last night, I watched it just
to see what I was getting myself into.

5
00:00:14,104 --> 00:00:16,244
(Leonard:)-Okay.
-And I have to be honest.

6
00:00:16,406 --> 00:00:19,906
(Raj:)I thought it was disturbing
and weird,

7
00:00:20,076 --> 00:00:22,286
(Raj:)and it made me wonder what it says
about someone who enjoys it.

8
00:00:22,445 --> 00:00:24,515
(Emily:)I wonder that too.

9
00:00:24,681 --> 00:00:26,461
(Raj:)Then why do you
watch these things?

10
00:00:26,616 --> 00:00:29,286
(Emily:)Can I tell you something
without you judging me?

11
00:00:29,453 --> 00:00:31,123
(Leonard:)Sure.

12
00:00:31,288 --> 00:00:33,198
(Emily:)They kind of turn me on.

13
00:00:33,356 --> 00:00:34,956
(Raj:)And play.

14
00:00:48,805 --> 00:00:51,545
(Sheldon:)Hello. I didn't expect you
this evening.

15
00:00:51,708 --> 00:00:55,158
(Amy:)Well, I was just feeling so bad
about lying to you the other night,

16
00:00:55,312 --> 00:00:57,982
l... wanted to make it up to you.

17
00:00:58,148 --> 00:01:00,128
(Sheldon:)And how do you propose to do that?

18
00:01:12,429 --> 00:01:14,639
(Sheldon:)Unless you have Gravity
on Blu-ray under that skirt,

19
00:01:14,798 --> 00:01:17,008
(Sheldon:)I don't know where
you're going with this.

